      "content": "thanks, i'll try the date grouping thing. it's just frustrating because it feels almost like... i don't know, like someone is intentionally messing with the numbers when i'm not looking. it's not just one big error, it's like a bunch of tiny, mischievous little things happening at once that throw everything off. do you think there's a technical reason why certain small amounts would just appear out of nowhere or change slightly between the bank statement and my ledger?",
